  "summary": "lighttpd vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the mod_wstunnel module in lighttpd incorrectly\nhandled certain invalid websocket handshakes. A remote attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause lighttpd to crash, resulting in a denial\nof service.",
